data: {"type": "code", "agent": "CodeWizard", "timestamp": "2026-11-10T19:19:37.802845", "content": {"agent": "CodeWizard", "language": "python", "code": "sns.set_theme(style='whitegrid', palette='husl')\ndata = {\n    'Quarter': ['Q1', 'Q2', 'Q3', 'Q4', '全年'],\n    'NetProfit': [156494308.41, 756329709.24, 1256306602.29, 1263159232.02, 3432289851.96]\n}\ndf = pd.DataFrame(data)\nfor col in df.columns:\n    if col != 'Quarter':\n        df[col] = pd.to_numeric(df[col], errors='coerce')\ndf = df.dropna()\ndf['NetProfit_yi'] = df['NetProfit'] / 1e8\nplt.figure(figsize=(12, 7), dpi=200)\nbars = plt.bar(df['Quarter'], df['NetProfit_yi'], color=['#6366f1', '#06b6d4', '#10b981', '#f59e0b', '#ef4444'])\nfor bar in bars:\n    height = bar.get_height()\n    plt.text(bar.get_x() + bar.get_width()/2, height, f'{height:.2f}亿', ha='center', va='bottom', fontsize=11)\nplt.title('中航成飞2025年分季度归母净利润', fontsize=18, fontweight='bold', pad=20)\nplt.xlabel('季度', fontsize=14)\nplt.ylabel('归母净利润（亿元）', fontsize=14)\nplt.xticks(fontsize=12)\nplt.yticks(fontsize=12)\nplt.grid(True, linestyle='--', alpha=0.3)\nsns.despine()\nplt.savefig('chart.png', dpi=200, bbox_inches='tight', facecolor='white')", "purpose": "从可用数据中提取2025年分季度归母净利润及全年加总，计算全年归母净利润为34.32亿元，并生成季度柱状图。同比变化方面，现有数据未披露2024年归母净利润，无法直接计算；片段中39.75亿元和6.16%指标待核实，不宜直接作为归母净利润同比结论。"}}

